{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/tutorial-blur-what-is-underneath-walk",
  "seed": "The third guide of the Looks track teaches the lens on the case people actually have: an address in a screenshot they are about to send on. The guide brings an account screen of its own, flattened the way a capture is, and the walk drives the whole thing: K, one drag over the address, the strength pulled up, and the same lens switched to blocks.",
  "setup": { "forget": ["tutorials", "panel", "tools"] },
  "steps": [
